<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>Submission 설정 예시 - 기본 데이터 포맷(JSON)과 대용량 데이터 포맷(Array)</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_d0c873a366b862db" class="chapter_title">Submission 설정 예시 - 기본 데이터 포맷(JSON)과 대용량 데이터 포맷(Array)</h1><h1 id="r_4f4161a68a38cebb" class="element heading1" data-element-id="4f4161a68a38cebb"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><p id="r_83c53cf2718473c5" class="element normal" data-element-id="83c53cf2718473c5">Submission 설정 중 target 설정에 대한 예시로 기본 데이터 포맷(JSON)과 대용량 데이터 포맷으로 주로 쓰이는 Array 설정에 대한 예시입니다.</p><p id="r_d5f6f2e7ee555209" class="element normal" data-element-id="d5f6f2e7ee555209">이 예제는 타입별 조회 버튼을 클릭하여 응답 데이터의 크기와 응답 데이터의 그리드 출력 속도를 비교하기 위해 작성되었습니다.</p><p id="r_913f64fb9dd669ac" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="913f64fb9dd669ac"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00052">P00052</a></p><h1 id="r_2a31f9b41750ee72" class="element heading1" data-element-id="2a31f9b41750ee72"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_6488e47893d8aa70" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="6488e47893d8aa70"><li><p>JSON 타입의 응답 데이터 조회</p></li><li><p>ARRAY 타입의 응답 데이터 조회</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_e02ceaaa7a3af753" class="element heading1" data-element-id="e02ceaaa7a3af753"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_ee7dd0b661680a29" class="element heading2" data-element-id="ee7dd0b661680a29"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>JSON 타입의 응답 데이터 조회</span></div></h2><div id="r_fe8c16e1b7a1115a" class="element step1" data-element-id="fe8c16e1b7a1115a"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">JSON 타입 조회</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다</p></div><p id="r_9b4ca3f5f523f6fe" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="9b4ca3f5f523f6fe">GridView에 데이터가 출력됩니다.</p><div id="r_d7fb66d2f857140f" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="d7fb66d2f857140f"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 개발자 도구 - Network</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image044.png" width="579" height="188" /></p></div><h2 id="r_f77c1fbde556b724" class="element heading2" data-element-id="f77c1fbde556b724"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>ARRAY 타입의 응답 데이터 조회</span></div></h2><div id="r_ed40677106f2b092" class="element step1" data-element-id="ed40677106f2b092"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">ARRAY 타입 조회</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다</p></div><p id="r_2be013690bcdf486" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="2be013690bcdf486">GridView에 데이터가 출력됩니다.</p><div id="r_a59c9d1e3a0885a3" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="a59c9d1e3a0885a3"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 개발자 도구 - Network</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image045.png" width="571" height="185" /></p></div><h1 id="r_bda274e7166efe7f" class="element heading1" data-element-id="bda274e7166efe7f"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>참고 링크</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_36817a34ff4ef9ab" class="element heading2" data-element-id="36817a34ff4ef9ab"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>예제</span></div></h2><ul id="r_6f677167a085362d" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="6f677167a085362d"><li><p>데이터 타입별 포맷 예시 : <a class="link" href="https://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00052">https://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00052</a></p></li></ul><h1 id="r_4c01c7ccc875e78c" class="element heading1" data-element-id="4c01c7ccc875e78c"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_baeb2817ed6c0536" class="element heading2" data-element-id="baeb2817ed6c0536"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">5.1</span><span>JSON 타입 설정</span></div></h2><p id="r_3ef87e375dcd68c8" class="element normal" data-element-id="3ef87e375dcd68c8">Submission의 target 속성을 아래와 같이 설정합니다.</p><div id="r_4521d6f8796973d0" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="4521d6f8796973d0"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Property - target</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_red_highlight_span">data:json,</span>dlt_Member</pre></div><div id="r_cf81faa97db68f0b" class="element image" data-element-id="cf81faa97db68f0b"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 3.</span>Submission 설정 예시 이미지</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image046.png" width="447" height="322" /></p></div><p id="r_a7be9d52f0385f11" class="element normal" data-element-id="a7be9d52f0385f11">아래는 응답 데이터 예시입니다. 예제 파일을 기준으로 몇몇 컬럼은 제거하고 1개의 행의 데이터만 추출하여 작성되었습니다.</p><div id="r_1997001a632a7d63" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="1997001a632a7d63"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 2.</span>Data</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>{
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"dlt_Member"</span> : [
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{<span class="r_h_string_span">"EMP_CD"</span>:10000000,<span class="r_h_string_span">"EMP_NM"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"신길동"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"GENDER_CD"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"M"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"JOIN_DATE"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"20040922"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"POSITION_CD"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"04"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"DUTY_CD"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"05"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"ROLE_CD"</span>:<span class="r_h_string_span">"02"</span>}
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;]
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>}</pre></div><h2 id="r_f828289c0803125b" class="element heading2" data-element-id="f828289c0803125b"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">5.2</span><span>ARRAY 타입 설정</span></div></h2><p id="r_c8c738afe80de274" class="element normal" data-element-id="c8c738afe80de274">Submission의 target 속성을 아래와 같이 설정합니다.</p><div id="r_47bbd142a36876b6" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="47bbd142a36876b6"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 3.</span>Property - target</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_red_highlight_span">data:array,</span>dlt_Member</pre></div><div id="r_1ec222dfa0eac97c" class="element image" data-element-id="1ec222dfa0eac97c"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 4.</span>Submission 설정 예시 이미지</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image047.png" width="448" height="324" /></p></div><p id="r_acb16dd52096c290" class="element normal" data-element-id="acb16dd52096c290">아래는 응답 데이터 예시입니다. 예제 파일을 기준으로 몇몇 컬럼은 제거하고 1개의 행의 데이터만 추출하여 작성되었습니다.</p><div id="r_ea1a5ff86e7efd68" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="ea1a5ff86e7efd68"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 4.</span>Data</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>{
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"dlt_Member"</span> : {
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"data"</span> : [<span class="r_h_number_span">10000000</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"신길동"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"M"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"20040922"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"04"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"05"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"02"</span>],
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"columnInfo"</span> : [<span class="r_h_string_span">"EMP_CD"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"EMP_NM"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"GENDER_CD"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"JOIN_DATE"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"POSITION_CD"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"DUTY_CD"</span>,<span class="r_h_string_span">"ROLE_CD"</span>]
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>}</pre></div></div></body></html>